OL,3,AThousands without water and roads
OL,4,Aclosed after burst pipe
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes in parts of West
OL,7,FSussex have water supply issues and a
OL,8,Fnumber of roads have flooded after what
OL,9,Fpolice are describing as a
OL,10,F"significant" leak.
OL,12,FRoads around the Southgate Roundabout
OL,13,Fin Crawley have been closed on Sunday
OL,14,Fmorning due to the burst water pipe,
OL,15,FSussex Police said.
OL,17,FSouthern Water said around 9,000
OL,18,Fcustomers were impacted and it was
OL,19,Fsetting up bottled water stations.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
